Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 15:47:41 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] feat(example): server-side browser sessions and a real
 user identity

Encrypted session store (AES-256-GCM, key file 0600, files 0600, opaque HttpOnly cookie) and the identity of the editor user: the Nextcloud user when connected, otherwise a local profile (display name, initials avatar); test users only in developer mode.

